OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry start in eastern
OL,6,Fcounties with variable cloud and
OL,7,Fbright spells. Cloud over the west
OL,8,Fwill soon spread to all parts through
OL,9,Fthe morning with some patchy light
OL,10,Frain.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry at first but soon
OL,13,Fclouding over from the west through
OL,14,Fthe evening and overnight with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavy at
OL,16,Ftimes. Becoming breezy towards morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
