OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy at first with some
OL,6,Flight rain or drizzle. Staying mostly
OL,7,Fcloudy through the day with further
OL,8,Frain or showers, heavy at times, but
OL,9,Fthe odd brighter spell possible.
OL,10,FBreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain on Wednesday, likely turning
OL,15,Fdrier later with some bright spells
OL,16,Fand showers. Bright spells and
OL,17,Fscattered showers on Thursday and
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
